623335", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035460_8514674871956668_5536053659043017688_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_tXzuoOYXz4Q7kNvwHHLddY&_nc_oc=AdoOHVqfC2BiI4jfGIaSgYqukneZsvLYDX4ooTSqI0jQibswMDbskrzoHP4jXk40ezU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBL53nwIa_KCgZHOs_qqpjuQZnvbbnsA_q2BhIDogd0ow&oe=6A5B7EE2"}, "display_name": "RCP VR", "keywords": ["CPR", "Training", "FirstAid", "Life", "Medical"], "long_description": "Have you ever wondered how you would react in a medical emergency?\n\nImagine this: you're at work, in a shopping mall, or walking down the street, and suddenly, someone collapses next to you. Would you know what to do?\n\nAt Four Players VR, we\u2019ve developed a Virtual Reality Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation (CPR) simulation that trains you to act with confidence and effectiveness in critical situations.\n\nGet ready to save lives:\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator).\n\nDon\u2019t let fear paralyze you. Join us and gain the skills you need to make a difference in critical moments with Four Players VR!", "short_description": "\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Hero Cover 3000x900-01.png", "id": "1521375421828587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982664_1521375425161920_9188152085567170692_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hTUrXqkt_v8Q7kNvwFLHhRO&_nc_oc=AdpPBXC8-kP7wJ8tjb0JOks6R_9Qip_ggk-Nm7ONVJX3hdiDHXHc-GIIEL2cMLLqlOQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB-uUP1cbspN_S10r_3VLX6L8EvfqJ8gVwJnvmIZZjFkA&oe=6A5B8C73"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Square 1440x1440-01.png", "id": "1067684668157887", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75221326_1067684671491220_581184548072541025_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OYgI4h-yEtwQ7kNvwHEPQF0&_nc_oc=AdpTFGbZKxPNcezjszijV5B5w5nP3uVh-_A-CCAfw5-JTWafSJ1zTXMo0fctqhj8OqQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBGpoHrSUr2zI_WIk423ed1ji9ycGEM5kh_xpkd7zQ2_w&oe=6A5B80EB"}, {"file_name": "Logo 9000x1440-01.png", "id": "875705051208789", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75339313_875705054542122_3606485636804263314_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=61o2YPeaabAQ7kNvwGwltxn&_nc_oc=AdqlFYUyFOzY4i0HIcsiy0hsg2VoexYG8rQR1iY3YAMS7F3IKz4vv_v_iHlnD_Tlj6o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC3SUSZGtgN4zOAh573pQ2gZ8CaHHjNPmOx0yCH2Rcedw&oe=6A5B65E2"}, {"file_name": "Icon 512x512-01.png", "id": "581195491100081", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57568678_581195494433414_3254618470938933182_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xvw8YTyV8JYQ7kNvwGr-JV9&_nc_oc=AdoFfMRGhau4llfm6f1xP4fT-W1_W69nHqfPel3FFI0O3rAJol8jpKpGvonl77JmdnU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBLkODli3zTH39TQO6sr0K7haLCJJxRP88kcMw-8vEE7Q&oe=6A5B687D"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Landscape 1008x1440-01.png", "id": "480126738396124", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982658_480126745062790_195688056568553292